==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Salazzle|31}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''Fire Claws''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Blaine's Charmeleon|31}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.<ref group="nb">Blaine's Charmeleon uses hiragana (ほのおのつめ) for the Japanese attack name, while all subsequent instances use katakana (ほのおのツメ) instead.</ref>
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

